    "gp_section_601179576173462103": {
      "type": "gp-section-601179576173462103",
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "7ec400d553783631165ef2453f0016bdff98a74c4d2f45fb45d0af6f3ee778d2_1_1_0_0__1",
        "ggoJRSyYobI_text": "<strong>The Real Reason You're Losing It After 40?</strong>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"color:#53AF02;\">Endothelial Dysfunction</span>",
        "ggS6bCCOT5l_text": "<p><strong>An erection isn't about desire. It's about blood flow.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>When you're aroused, blood rushes into your penis and gets trapped there. That's what makes it hard.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>When it's working, you don't even think about it.</p>",
        "ggHFPNmjbiO_childItem_0": "<p>Blood rushes in on demand.</p>",
        "ggHFPNmjbiO_childItem_1": "<p>You get hard. You stay hard.&nbsp;</p>",
        "ggHFPNmjbiO_childItem_2": "<p>Morning wood shows up like clockwork.</p>",
        "gg0GrYv1Gy-_text": "<p><strong>But here's what most men don't know:</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The inner lining of your blood vessels — called the endothelium — controls exactly how much blood can flow in.</p>",
        "ggwAhgKYXsz_text": "<p><strong>After 40, this lining starts to break down.</strong></p>",
        "ggLARpbWRl-_childItem_0": "<p>The endothelium gets damaged.</p>",
        "ggLARpbWRl-_childItem_1": "<p>Nitric Oxide production drops.</p>",
        "ggLARpbWRl-_childItem_2": "<p>Blood vessels can't relax and open.</p>",
        "ggLARpbWRl-_childItem_3": "<p>Blood trickles instead of rushes.</p>",
        "gg9PUi-xaK7_text": "<p><strong>An erection isn't about desire. It's about blood flow.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>When you're aroused, blood rushes into your penis and gets trapped there. That's what makes it hard.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>When it's working, you don't even think about it.</p>",
        "ggWt134VydO_childItem_0": "<p>That's why you can only get semi-hard.</p>",
        "ggWt134VydO_childItem_1": "<p>That's why you can't stay hard long enough to penetrate.</p>",
        "ggWt134VydO_childItem_2": "<p>That's why morning wood disappeared.</p>",
        "ggWt134VydO_childItem_3": "<p>That&#039;s why you&#039;re stuck in your head during sex.</p>",
        "ggRa1ri3aga_text": "<p><strong>Your blood vessels can't deliver blood where it needs to go — and your erection is paying the price.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The longer you wait, the worse Endothelial Dysfunction gets.</p>"
      }
